[[3,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Work cautiously so as not to dirty\nor damage the trim.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (Left and right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892217\">7045A02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892245\">7050A90</a>\n                                           (all)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892198\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2891667\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892200\">7040H34</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892201\">7040H42</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892192\">7040G40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892183\">7040B18</a>\n                                           (Left and right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892199\">7040H33</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892288\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2891986\">5580E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892189\">7040E50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892287\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (all)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892188\">7040E17</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892150\">7030B32</a>\n                                           (front and rear)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892151\">7030B62</a>\n                                           (front\nand rear)</p><p>1. Undo the bolts on the seat belt cover.</p><p>2. Remove the cover.</p><p>3. Remove the seals of the 4 door frames near the ceiling trim.</p><p>4. Remove the retainers using the appropriate tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Remove the ceiling trim and take it out of the interior compartment\nthrough the front right door.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035747.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the cover is undamaged.</p><p>Fit the ceiling trim, inserting it into\nthe interior compartment through the front right door.</p><p>Fit the retainers.</p><p>Fit the 4 door seals.</p><p>Fit the seat belt cover.</p><p>Tighten the cover bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892151\">7030B62</a>\n                                           (front\nand rear)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892150\">7030B32</a>\n                                           (front and rear)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892188\">7040E17</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892287\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (all)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892189\">7040E50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891986\">5580E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892288\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892199\">7040H33</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892183\">7040B18</a>\n                                           (Left and right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892192\">7040G40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892201\">7040H42</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892200\">7040H34</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2891667\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892198\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p><a href=\"#/2892245\">7050A90</a>\n                                           (all)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892217\">7045A02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (Left\nand right).</p><p>Check that all the parts are fitted correctly\nand check the operation of removed electrical components.</p>"]]